WEBVTT

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.042
November: the month of maturity.

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:11.500
"Future Planning Survey" "Name: Nagisa Shiota"
November: the month of maturity.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.042
"Future Planning Survey" "Name: Nagisa Shiota"
Everyone's starting to give their own answers.

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:16.083
"Future Planning Survey" "Name: Nagisa Shiota"
At that point,

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:19.750
we had four months left
to assassinate Koro Sensei.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.292
Is that octopus seriously
doing career counseling?

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.625
Professor Bitch!

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:29.333
In regular clothes!

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:32.042
Yes, regular old cheap clothes.

00:00:32.042 --> 00:00:36.583
Just trying to match your regular old world.

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:40.875
What? You want me
to show more skin after all?

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:44.667
No--hiding it has actually
made you <i>more </i>sexy.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:46.958
In a way, you've grown!

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:49.000
"Desired School: Girls' High School"

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.125
"Desired School: Girls' High School"
Hey, Nakamura! <i>You </i>wrote this!

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:51.083
"Desired Career (1st Choice): Nurse" "(2nd Choice): Maid"
Hey, Nakamura! <i>You </i>wrote this!

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.750
"Desired Career (1st Choice): Nurse" "(2nd Choice): Maid"
Why would you warp a person's career path like that?!

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:56.625
Men's work doesn't suit you.

00:00:56.625 --> 00:00:58.208
Hey, Nagisa!

00:00:58.208 --> 00:00:58.333
"Thailand" "Be Reborn!" "Morocco" "A Life-Altering Voyage"
Hey, Nagisa!

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:02.083
"Thailand" "Be Reborn!" "Morocco" "A Life-Altering Voyage"
Let's hit Thailand or Morocco after graduation.

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.333
"Thailand" "Be Reborn!" "Morocco" "A Life-Altering Voyage"
I understand Thailand is where it's at.

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:07.167
"Thailand" "Be Reborn!" "Morocco" "A Life-Altering Voyage"
Why are you trying to cut it off me?

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.833
Why are you trying to cut it off me?

00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:10.667
Careers, eh?

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:15.875
And taking advice from a monster
who says he'll destroy the earth!

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:19.000
My career...

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:23.625
"Midterm Report Card, Year 3, Term 2"

00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:46.250
<i>You're all I think about</i>

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.083
<i>Starting not to see anything else</i>

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:54.542
<i>I'll win your heart for sure--I swear</i>

00:01:54.542 --> 00:01:57.208
<i>Me, not cool? Oh, that old tale</i>

00:01:57.208 --> 00:01:59.917
<i>I've spared no effort since then</i>

00:01:59.917 --> 00:02:03.708
<i>Should be over my problems by now</i>

00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:07.708
<i>I'm brimming with confidence: I can do it</i>

00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:10.667
<i>And just when I get warmed up</i>

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:15.875
<i>Yeah, I get knocked down like this every time</i>

00:02:15.875 --> 00:02:21.458
<i>Your scathing, serious voice cuts me</i>

00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:26.875
<i>Thousands, tens of thousands</i>
<i>of times I've given form to my feelings</i>

00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:32.375
<i>Driven them in,</i>
<i>thrown them in--but all you do is run</i>

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:35.042
<i>Question, question: what</i>

00:02:35.042 --> 00:02:37.708
<i>Question, question: on earth</i>

00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:40.500
<i>Question, question: did I</i>

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.083
<i>Ever know about you anyway?</i>

00:02:43.083 --> 00:02:45.792
<i>Question, question: why</i>

00:02:45.792 --> 00:02:48.500
<i>Question, question: is it</i>

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.333
<i>Question, question: you are</i>

00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:56.292
<i>So close and yet so far away?</i>

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:04.167
"Ninth Period: Round Two Time"
"by Toka Yada"

00:03:04.167 --> 00:03:05.458
"Staff Room"

00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:08.875
"Staff Room"
So you're looking to become a bureaucrat?

00:03:08.875 --> 00:03:10.875
"Staff Room"
Behind the scenes of national administration...

00:03:10.875 --> 00:03:11.542
Behind the scenes of national administration...

00:03:11.542 --> 00:03:14.500
That's rather restrained for you, Karma.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:19.208
You know how politicians
were useless during the last quake?

00:03:19.208 --> 00:03:21.167
I can't deny that.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:25.792
But the country wasn't paralyzed--
it kept functioning remarkably well.

00:03:25.792 --> 00:03:31.125
The bureaucrats pulling strings
in the shadows must be pretty great.

00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:33.708
So that's what I want to be.

00:03:33.708 --> 00:03:35.292
Got a problem?

00:03:35.292 --> 00:03:38.917
No; that's you to a T.

00:03:41.917 --> 00:03:44.750
Terasaka, don't be a politician.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.000
Huh?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:50.750
A big-mouthed impulsive fool
like you on the ticket?

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.292
It'd be a cinch to control you from the wings.

00:03:53.292 --> 00:03:58.208
Bah! Controllin' me? You're delusional.

00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:00.833
A politician? Where'd that come from?

00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:01.792
"Name: Rio Nakamura" "Desired Career (1st Choice): Diplomat"
A politician? Where'd that come from?

00:04:01.792 --> 00:04:05.167
"Name: Rio Nakamura" "Desired Career (1st Choice): Diplomat"
Nakamura, you want to be a diplomat?

00:04:05.167 --> 00:04:09.042
For you to have such an earnest goal...!

00:04:09.042 --> 00:04:11.000
That's super-rude!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.000
Believe it or not, they used to
call me the primary-school genius.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.583
In first grade,
I aced all the sixth-grade tests,

00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:21.208
and always came in at the top of the class!

00:04:21.208 --> 00:04:26.250
But normal was better. I wanted to be normal.

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:31.375
I wanted to get lousy scores
and joke about them with my friends.

00:04:31.375 --> 00:04:34.958
I managed to make it into
Kunugigaoka and played dumb

00:04:34.958 --> 00:04:37.708
until I wasn't playing anymore.

00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:40.208
Seeing my parents' disappointed tears,

00:04:40.208 --> 00:04:44.083
I finally began to realize
the importance of what I'd lost.

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:48.083
But I did want to do dumb stuff
with everyone else, too.

00:04:48.083 --> 00:04:51.167
This class lets me do both.

00:04:51.167 --> 00:04:54.167
Thank you, Koro Sensei.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.708
"Future Planning Survey" "Name: Nagisa Shiota"
Miss Irina, Miss Irina!

00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:02.375
"Future Planning Survey" "Name: Nagisa Shiota"
No one looks like they're thinking hard, but they sure are.

00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:03.667
--About that present!
--But I...

00:05:03.667 --> 00:05:05.125
--Oh, that!
--But I...

00:05:05.125 --> 00:05:06.458
--Oh, Miss Irina's tag is still attached.

00:05:06.458 --> 00:05:09.708
--Men give all sorts of different presents, you see, and...
--Oh, Miss Irina's tag is still attached.

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:11.708
She's not used to buying off the rack.

00:05:11.708 --> 00:05:13.542
Should we tell her?

00:05:13.542 --> 00:05:15.708
I'll get it.

00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:19.167
Besides, that car was a war trophy I won

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:24.292
by coming on to a young IT CEO for intel.

00:05:24.292 --> 00:05:28.083
I had every intention of driving that car, too,

00:05:28.083 --> 00:05:33.208
but Karasuma said I
"obtained it by fraudulent means"!

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:41.083
Last but not least!
So what's your chosen career, Nagisa?

00:05:41.083 --> 00:05:46.250
Sir, I... I think...

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.458
I think I have a talent for killing people.

00:05:49.458 --> 00:05:53.583
At any rate, I think I could
get to where I do what the Reaper does.

00:05:53.583 --> 00:05:55.667
For someone with no real strengths,

00:05:55.667 --> 00:05:59.833
I couldn't hope for
a better talent for my future.

00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:06.792
Koro Sensei... should I...

00:06:06.792 --> 00:06:09.708
Should I become an assassin?

00:06:09.708 --> 00:06:14.708
Please... tell me what path I should follow.

00:06:17.667 --> 00:06:20.417
You're a sensible student.

00:06:20.417 --> 00:06:23.042
You must have considered
the risk and absurdity

00:06:23.042 --> 00:06:26.875
of becoming an assassin
before asking me this question.

00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:32.583
Nagisa, there can be no doubt
that you have a gift for assassination.

00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:38.083
Whether facing a monster,
a violent teacher, or a genius assassin,

00:06:38.083 --> 00:06:42.250
you have the courage to attack without fear.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:46.417
For a master killer,
that's an indispensable skill.

00:06:46.417 --> 00:06:48.250
But, Nagisa...

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:53.042
...this courage of yours
is fraught with desperation.

00:06:53.042 --> 00:06:56.667
You're taking your own safety
and dignity too lightly:

00:06:56.667 --> 00:07:01.167
"It hardly matters
what happens to someone like <i>me</i>."

00:07:01.167 --> 00:07:04.125
To what end should you use your talents?

00:07:04.125 --> 00:07:06.500
And for whom?

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:12.500
Reexamine these questions.
Then we'll talk again.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:15.542
And if you still want to be an assassin,

00:07:15.542 --> 00:07:18.583
I'll support you with everything I have.

00:07:20.792 --> 00:07:23.667
Whoa, you beat it? Even the secret boss?!

00:07:23.667 --> 00:07:25.125
Not on my first playthrough.

00:07:25.125 --> 00:07:27.167
But I managed to beat him
on the second round.

00:07:27.167 --> 00:07:29.333
Oh, sure. Guess it's time to start over!

00:07:29.333 --> 00:07:32.792
"Continue" "New Game" "Wi-Fi Connection"
Oh, sure. Guess it's time to start over!

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.708
I'm home.

00:07:35.708 --> 00:07:39.333
Welcome back, Nagisa. Have a seat.

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:42.167
What is it, Mom?

00:07:42.167 --> 00:07:46.542
Your midterms.
You came in 54th in your grade.

00:07:46.542 --> 00:07:51.083
You missed the 50th-place cutoff
for returning to the main school.

00:07:51.083 --> 00:07:56.250
But I heard that Tanaka's older brother

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.833
made it back from 60th place three years ago.

00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:00.167
"Kunugigaoka Junior High" "Donation Enclosed"
made it back from 60th place three years ago.

00:08:00.167 --> 00:08:02.500
"Kunugigaoka Junior High" "Donation Enclosed"
After begging and pleading with donation in hand,

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.125
"Kunugigaoka Junior High" "Donation Enclosed"
the school made an exception.

00:08:05.125 --> 00:08:11.708
So that's what I'll do. You've got to
get out of that E Class ASAP.

00:08:11.708 --> 00:08:14.875
I'll be speaking with Mr. Ono
of the D Class soon.

00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:16.167
You'll be coming with me.

00:08:16.167 --> 00:08:19.083
H-Hey, no, wait, Mom!

00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:21.042
I want to stay in the E Class!

00:08:21.042 --> 00:08:23.667
It's fun, and my grades are improving!

00:08:23.667 --> 00:08:26.667
I'll go anywhere you tell me
for college and work--

00:08:26.667 --> 00:08:30.500
just please, let me stay where I am for junior--

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.625
Uh-oh.

00:08:32.625 --> 00:08:35.000
I defied her during a dark phase.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.958
This isn't good.

00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:38.000
Here it comes.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:38.542
Ow!

00:08:38.542 --> 00:08:43.542
Watch your mouth! How could I have
raised such an ambitionless child?

00:08:43.542 --> 00:08:46.375
The wounds of failure will
torture you your whole life long!

00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:49.250
I should know! Why can't you
understand your own mother,

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.583
who only wants to spare you that same pain?!

00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:56.083
Here I am getting another
donation ready for your bad grades!

00:08:56.083 --> 00:09:01.417
See what your mother does for you?
Just who do you think you are?

00:09:01.417 --> 00:09:04.000
There's no talking to her when she's like this.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:08.792
It was my mistake for not
speaking up when she was still sunny.

00:09:08.792 --> 00:09:13.167
I'm sorry. I had no idea.

00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:21.083
Dad hates fighting.
He got fed up and walked out.

00:09:21.083 --> 00:09:25.125
Now listen: You're just a child,

00:09:25.125 --> 00:09:28.750
so how would <i>you </i>understand
how to make your way through life?

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.250
But your mom knows all about it!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:36.667
I have a plan, so you won't
wind up like me and your father.

00:09:36.667 --> 00:09:39.417
Like getting into Keisetsu University.

00:09:39.417 --> 00:09:40.375
The top school Mom couldn't test into.

00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:42.417
"Keisetsu University"
The top school Mom couldn't test into.

00:09:42.417 --> 00:09:42.792
The top school Mom couldn't test into.

00:09:42.792 --> 00:09:45.833
Big companies have school ties,

00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:49.875
and your success hinges on
whether you went to that school.

00:09:49.875 --> 00:09:53.958
A Keisetsu grad can work
at the top-ranked Hishimaru...

00:09:53.958 --> 00:09:54.958
The famous company Mom couldn't get hired into.

00:09:54.958 --> 00:09:57.042
"Hishimaru"
The famous company Mom couldn't get hired into.

00:09:57.042 --> 00:09:57.833
The famous company Mom couldn't get hired into.

00:09:57.833 --> 00:10:02.167
Oh, and while I'm talking about
an ideal world... I so wanted a girl.

00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:04.167
She says this a lot, too.

00:10:04.167 --> 00:10:08.750
My parents were all about the studying.
Girlishness came second.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:12.375
That's why I didn't make it
into Hishimaru, with its focus on looks.

00:10:12.375 --> 00:10:17.500
And that's why I'd teach
<i>my </i>daughter fashion all I wanted.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:21.125
See how nice it looks with your long hair?

00:10:21.125 --> 00:10:25.750
I don't want to hear it. I'm not a girl.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.958
Her tenacity was chilling.

00:10:28.958 --> 00:10:32.417
I'd likely never be able to defy her.

00:10:32.417 --> 00:10:34.208
Koro Sensei saw right through me:

00:10:34.208 --> 00:10:34.708
"The Game of Life: Hiromi Shiota"
Koro Sensei saw right through me:

00:10:34.708 --> 00:10:38.375
"The Game of Life: Hiromi Shiota"
I'm not the hero of my own life.

00:10:38.375 --> 00:10:40.125
"The Game of Life: Hiromi Shiota"
I'm in round two of the "Mom" RPG.

00:10:40.125 --> 00:10:41.500
"New Game" "Continue"
I'm in round two of the "Mom" RPG.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.875
"New Game +"
I'm in round two of the "Mom" RPG.

00:10:43.292 --> 00:10:44.417
Oh, and...

00:10:44.417 --> 00:10:49.417
I'll be coming in tomorrow to ask
the E Class teacher for a transfer.

00:10:50.875 --> 00:10:52.083
Huh?

00:10:52.083 --> 00:10:54.875
Th-That's pretty sudden. He might be busy.

00:10:54.875 --> 00:10:57.208
It's for your own good, Nagisa.

00:10:57.208 --> 00:11:00.875
Say your goodbyes to the E Class tomorrow.

00:11:00.875 --> 00:11:03.958
She's gone dark again.

00:11:03.958 --> 00:11:07.125
Nothing I can say will do any good.

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:11.208
I see. So your mother's coming
to discuss a class transfer?

00:11:11.208 --> 00:11:15.792
What now? My mom
won't listen to a word I say.

00:11:15.792 --> 00:11:18.208
Mr. Karasuma's out on business,

00:11:18.208 --> 00:11:22.250
and I can't ask his underlings
to step in on his behalf...

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:26.875
Most of all, I don't want to leave the E Class.

00:11:26.875 --> 00:11:29.292
Don't worry about a thing.

00:11:29.292 --> 00:11:31.917
I'm a super-creature who'll destroy the earth--

00:11:31.917 --> 00:11:35.500
parent-and-child meetings are no problem!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.250
I-I don't know about this.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:42.250
"Assassination Classroom, Second Season"
"by Nagisa Shiota"

00:11:43.792 --> 00:11:47.625
Your mom, huh? She's a tough cookie.

00:11:47.625 --> 00:11:50.667
Koro Sensei said to let him handle it, but...

00:11:50.667 --> 00:11:53.000
I could pretend to be your teacher.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:53.833
Huh?

00:11:53.833 --> 00:11:58.583
No. On paper, Mr. Karasuma is our teacher.

00:11:58.583 --> 00:12:01.042
If our parents talk, it won't add up.

00:12:01.042 --> 00:12:02.458
Oh.

00:12:03.875 --> 00:12:05.375
It's really quite simple:

00:12:05.375 --> 00:12:08.917
I'd just need to become Tadaomi Karasuma.

00:12:08.917 --> 00:12:10.708
Koro Sensei?

00:12:10.708 --> 00:12:13.750
It's me! Me! Y'know, Karasuma!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.583
What a shoddy dupe!

00:12:15.583 --> 00:12:17.667
What's with the scribbling
between the eyebrows?

00:12:17.667 --> 00:12:21.375
I'm accentuatin' Karasuma's nihilism!
Spittin' image, right?

00:12:21.375 --> 00:12:23.708
And why do your arms look like sausages?

00:12:23.708 --> 00:12:26.458
Those're Karasuma's bulgin' muscles!

00:12:26.458 --> 00:12:28.083
--Quit obsessing over the most pointless details!
--I'm uneasy, but all I can do is pray.

00:12:28.083 --> 00:12:30.250
--At least put on a nose and ears!
--I'm uneasy, but all I can do is pray.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:33.792
--Yeah, add a nose and lose the fake drawl!
--Pray that Koro Sensei could convince my mother...

00:12:33.792 --> 00:12:37.375
...to let me stay in the E Class.

00:12:37.375 --> 00:12:38.958
Is that Nagisa's...

00:12:38.958 --> 00:12:40.458
She's really pretty!

00:12:40.458 --> 00:12:42.667
But she does look tough.

00:12:42.667 --> 00:12:43.875
"Staff Room"

00:12:43.875 --> 00:12:45.292
"Staff Room"
Nice to meet you.

00:12:45.292 --> 00:12:48.208
I'm Nagisa Shiota's mother.

00:12:48.208 --> 00:12:52.208
Please, have a seat. You, too, Nagisa.

00:12:52.208 --> 00:12:55.125
It's quite a trip,
all the way here to the mountains.

00:12:55.125 --> 00:12:57.458
How about something cold to drink?

00:12:57.458 --> 00:13:00.500
I-I guess that'll do.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.583
You know, you're really
quite beautiful, ma'am.

00:13:03.583 --> 00:13:06.500
I see Nagisa takes after you.

00:13:07.167 --> 00:13:09.125
This one here...

00:13:09.125 --> 00:13:12.917
If he were a girl, I would have
brought him up to be my ideal.

00:13:12.917 --> 00:13:14.292
Your ideal?

00:13:14.292 --> 00:13:19.875
Yes--a girl this age looks best with long hair.

00:13:19.875 --> 00:13:23.792
I was only allowed to have
short hair as a child...

00:13:23.792 --> 00:13:27.500
I got mad when he started
tying it back for school this year,

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:31.958
but it just looks so good
on him, I let it slide.

00:13:31.958 --> 00:13:34.375
Oh, yes--future plans.

00:13:34.375 --> 00:13:39.417
In my experience, they cannot
be allowed to be discouraged at this age.

00:13:39.417 --> 00:13:43.833
Several local Kunugigaoka High grads
have gone on to Kei U,

00:13:43.833 --> 00:13:45.917
but being so far off the track in junior high

00:13:45.917 --> 00:13:49.167
will hurt both his
college chances and his career.

00:13:49.167 --> 00:13:54.583
So I'd like your help in
getting him out of the E Class.

00:13:55.333 --> 00:13:57.750
Have you spoken with Nagisa about this?

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:58.833
He doesn't understand anything yet.

00:13:58.833 --> 00:14:00.792
"Out of Order"
He doesn't understand anything yet.

00:14:00.792 --> 00:14:03.083
"Out of Order"
It's only natural for a parent who's tasted failure

00:14:03.083 --> 00:14:05.542
"Out of Order"
to build their child a path.

00:14:05.542 --> 00:14:06.708
"Out of Order"
Mom?

00:14:06.708 --> 00:14:07.375
I--

00:14:07.375 --> 00:14:10.625
You hush now, Nagisa, okay?

00:14:14.083 --> 00:14:20.500
I see. I understand why Nagisa
came to be who he is today.

00:14:21.667 --> 00:14:22.750
A wi--?!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:23.833
Yes:

00:14:23.833 --> 00:14:28.167
I, Tadaomi Karasuma, wear a wig!

00:14:30.125 --> 00:14:32.292
Hairstyles, high schools, and colleges

00:14:32.292 --> 00:14:34.417
are not for a parent to decide.

00:14:34.417 --> 00:14:37.292
Nagisa must decide for himself.

00:14:37.792 --> 00:14:38.958
Ma'am,

00:14:38.958 --> 00:14:42.042
Nagisa's life is his to live.

00:14:42.042 --> 00:14:43.042
He's not a tool for hiding your own complexes.

00:14:43.042 --> 00:14:45.042
"Out of Order"
He's not a tool for hiding your own complexes.

00:14:45.833 --> 00:14:49.417
As his teacher, let me be very clear:

00:14:49.417 --> 00:14:51.208
Unless Nagisa wishes it,

00:14:51.208 --> 00:14:54.042
I will not permit him to leave the E Class.

00:14:59.292 --> 00:15:02.833
What's your deal?! What teacher
talks to a parent like that?

00:15:02.833 --> 00:15:04.042
How dare you insult me!

00:15:04.042 --> 00:15:06.667
--You think you're so great that you can nitpick my education plan?!

00:15:06.667 --> 00:15:07.333
--Yikes.
--You think you're so great that you can nitpick my education plan?!

00:15:07.333 --> 00:15:08.625
--Holy crap!
--I won't stand to be lectured by a moron teaching morons

00:15:08.625 --> 00:15:10.000
--Nagisa's mom is <i>pissed</i>!
--I won't stand to be lectured by a moron teaching morons

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.708
--Nagisa's mom is <i>pissed</i>!
--out in the mountains!

00:15:11.708 --> 00:15:13.750
Nagisa! So all your acts of defiance lately

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:16.167
are because this bald bugger suckered you in?!

00:15:16.167 --> 00:15:17.208
Well, watch this!

00:15:17.208 --> 00:15:20.458
I'm about to open your eyes,
all right--<i>way </i>open!

00:15:22.583 --> 00:15:23.875
Koro Sensei...

00:15:23.875 --> 00:15:27.667
Hmm. I was a bit more
forceful than I'd planned.

00:15:27.667 --> 00:15:30.042
Still...

00:15:30.042 --> 00:15:35.750
...what's most important is that you
make your own intentions perfectly clear.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:39.417
But right now, since I can't
do anything on my own,

00:15:39.417 --> 00:15:42.333
maybe I should just be Mom's round two.

00:15:42.333 --> 00:15:44.917
It's not like you can't do <i>anything</i>.

00:15:44.917 --> 00:15:47.625
If you have the urge to kill,
you can do anything.

00:15:47.625 --> 00:15:52.667
Your life's first round
started here in this classroom.

00:15:53.333 --> 00:15:57.250
My... my first round...

00:15:59.333 --> 00:16:00.792
Looks good.

00:16:00.792 --> 00:16:05.208
Sorry for blowing up in front of
your teacher today, Nagisa.

00:16:05.208 --> 00:16:07.792
I'm just so invested.

00:16:07.792 --> 00:16:08.875
Uh-huh.

00:16:08.875 --> 00:16:11.458
And, well, I've been thinking.

00:16:11.458 --> 00:16:12.292
Huh?

00:16:12.292 --> 00:16:18.250
I've decided I will <i>not </i>allow
anyone to interfere with my life.

00:16:22.208 --> 00:16:25.042
I'll remove the obstacles.

00:16:25.042 --> 00:16:30.250
I'll give you a new outlook on life... Nagisa.

00:16:37.375 --> 00:16:39.875
Sch... school?

00:16:39.875 --> 00:16:41.333
Mom?

00:16:41.333 --> 00:16:47.500
You went crazy after you were
sent down here. Started disobeying me.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.458
What--

00:16:48.458 --> 00:16:53.292
Burn it. Burn down the school--
with your own hands.

00:16:53.292 --> 00:16:55.917
What... what are you saying, Mom?

00:16:55.917 --> 00:16:57.833
If you set the fire with your own hands,

00:16:57.833 --> 00:17:01.958
your sense of guilt will keep you
from ever facing anyone here again.

00:17:01.958 --> 00:17:03.500
With your escape route cut off,

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.292
we'll go ask the
main-campus teacher to take you.

00:17:06.292 --> 00:17:07.375
N-No, I don't want to!

00:17:07.375 --> 00:17:09.417
Who do you think raised you?!

00:17:09.417 --> 00:17:11.292
Made you go to cram schools?
To a private school?

00:17:11.292 --> 00:17:14.333
Do you have any idea how much
time and money you cost me?!

00:17:14.333 --> 00:17:16.750
Making dinner even though
I'm tired from work!

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.500
You have no clue how I've suffered!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:22.167
Being brainwashed by that
clueless cue-ball--learning only defiance?!

00:17:22.167 --> 00:17:28.333
<i>I'm </i>the one who made you--made all of you!

00:17:29.042 --> 00:17:32.792
She's wrong! But she's right.

00:17:32.792 --> 00:17:36.333
How can I express this feeling...?

00:17:36.333 --> 00:17:41.292
First you must make your own
intentions perfectly clear.

00:17:45.417 --> 00:17:48.208
Mom... I--

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.750
Quit your screeching, you old bag.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.292
The show's about to start.

00:17:55.292 --> 00:17:58.583
--Wh-Who are <i>you</i>?! Get out of my way!
--That bloodlust... He's an assassin!

00:17:58.583 --> 00:18:00.958
<i>You're </i>the ones in <i>my </i>way.

00:18:00.958 --> 00:18:04.708
He comes every Wednesday
at ten to watch TV dramas

00:18:04.708 --> 00:18:06.708
with the autonomous artillery.

00:18:06.708 --> 00:18:09.625
He'll come that way at the speed of sound.

00:18:09.625 --> 00:18:12.625
I'll split his head open
with my whip and kill him.

00:18:12.625 --> 00:18:14.333
Kill...?

00:18:14.333 --> 00:18:17.625
What? P-Police!

00:18:17.625 --> 00:18:21.458
If I kill the kid,
the bounty goes up in smoke...

00:18:21.458 --> 00:18:25.625
...but they don't much care if I kill his old lady.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:33.458
Mom's afraid.
The assassin's got his guard down.

00:18:33.458 --> 00:18:37.292
Mom, a life spent watching for your reactions

00:18:37.292 --> 00:18:41.000
has cultivated a talent within me.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.958
It may not be the talent
you wanted me to have...

00:18:44.958 --> 00:18:49.958
...but it's that talent that lets me
be of use to everyone here.

00:18:49.958 --> 00:18:55.333
Your life's first round
started here in this classroom.

00:18:55.333 --> 00:19:01.333
Mom, I'm giving it
everything I have in this class now.

00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:03.917
And before I graduate, I'll get results.

00:19:03.917 --> 00:19:07.167
If I succeed, I'll cut my hair...

00:19:07.167 --> 00:19:11.167
...and pay back all the money
you spent to raise me.

00:19:11.167 --> 00:19:13.583
If you still can't forgive me...

00:19:13.583 --> 00:19:15.583
What's this?

00:19:15.583 --> 00:19:19.042
Then I'll graduate from you, too.

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.625
Mom...

00:19:30.625 --> 00:19:35.417
I'm so, so grateful just that
you had me and raised me.

00:19:35.417 --> 00:19:39.917
It may be extravagant,
but if you could just be happy

00:19:39.917 --> 00:19:43.958
that your child was born in this world
and grew up fairly okay,

00:19:43.958 --> 00:19:47.917
everything would be
tied up in a neat little bow...

00:19:47.917 --> 00:19:52.333
Wh-Who are you?
What have you done, Nagisa?

00:19:52.333 --> 00:19:55.708
Some undesirables
have made this their hangout,

00:19:55.708 --> 00:19:59.583
so I recommend staying away at night.

00:19:59.583 --> 00:20:00.875
Koro Sensei...

00:20:00.875 --> 00:20:01.000
"Fire Extinguisher"
Koro Sensei...

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:04.083
"Fire Extinguisher"
You just swore fair and square you'd kill me before March.

00:20:04.083 --> 00:20:06.208
"Fire Extinguisher"
No backsies!

00:20:06.208 --> 00:20:08.833
"Fire Extinguisher"
Urgh... I know.

00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:10.917
Now, then, ma'am...

00:20:10.917 --> 00:20:17.542
Yes, Nagisa is still immature.
But please, watch over him warmly.

00:20:17.542 --> 00:20:20.375
He is <i>not </i>trying to betray you.

00:20:20.375 --> 00:20:25.625
He's just starting to get ready
to leave the nest, as everyone must.

00:20:25.625 --> 00:20:31.083
Pulling away... from me? Nagisa?

00:20:31.083 --> 00:20:32.625
Mom!

00:20:32.625 --> 00:20:36.250
It seems she fainted when her nerves relaxed.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:40.042
I'll take you back in her car.

00:20:41.583 --> 00:20:43.417
So, Nagisa...

00:20:43.417 --> 00:20:45.667
If you <i>did </i>manage to kill me,

00:20:45.667 --> 00:20:51.125
would you go on to use your talent
to become an assassin?

00:20:51.125 --> 00:20:54.583
Probably not.

00:20:54.583 --> 00:20:58.458
Talent isn't only for <i>this </i>or <i>that</i>.

00:20:58.458 --> 00:21:00.875
Even if my talent is good for assassination,

00:21:00.875 --> 00:21:06.083
I want to use it to help someone--
like I protected Mom.

00:21:06.083 --> 00:21:11.333
And that's not by being
an assassin. Way too dangerous.

00:21:11.333 --> 00:21:15.417
I'll find a career that won't worry my folks.

00:21:15.417 --> 00:21:17.875
Take your time.

00:21:17.875 --> 00:21:21.833
Oh, and don't forget to make an effort
to talk with your parents.

00:21:21.833 --> 00:21:23.417
I won't.

00:21:25.667 --> 00:21:28.500
Sheesh, cars are slow
<i>and </i>you have to wait for lights!

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:30.583
How inconvenient can you get?

00:21:30.583 --> 00:21:32.250
"Koro Sensei's Weak Point #30: Gets testy when driving"

00:21:35.458 --> 00:21:37.167
What's this?

00:21:37.167 --> 00:21:39.875
I'll make breakfast from now on,

00:21:39.875 --> 00:21:42.833
so you can take it easy before work.

00:21:42.833 --> 00:21:43.667
<i>The moon that swims in the night sky</i>
so you can take it easy before work.

00:21:43.667 --> 00:21:45.625
<i>The moon that swims in the night sky</i>
I'll take out the garbage and stuff, too,

00:21:45.625 --> 00:21:47.208
<i>The moon that swims in the night sky</i>
and I'll get into a high school

00:21:47.208 --> 00:21:48.333
<i>The moon that swims in the night sky</i>
just as good as Kunugigaoka High!

00:21:48.333 --> 00:21:50.042
<i>If you stretch out your hand, you can reach it</i>
just as good as Kunugigaoka High!

00:21:50.042 --> 00:21:53.708
<i>If you stretch out your hand, you can reach it</i>
So please, let me stay in this class!

00:21:53.708 --> 00:21:56.958
<i>I went to touch it: it was warm</i>
<i>  </i>

00:21:56.958 --> 00:21:59.375
<i>I went to touch it: it was warm</i>
Do what you want. I don't care.

00:21:59.375 --> 00:22:03.000
<i>And slowly drew me in</i>
Do what you want. I don't care.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.542
<i>And slowly drew me in</i>
I am an assassin--

00:22:04.542 --> 00:22:04.750
<i>The multiplying footsteps, the view from my window:</i>
I am an assassin--

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:07.917
<i>The multiplying footsteps, the view from my window:</i>
holding my head high till graduation!

00:22:07.917 --> 00:22:15.917
<i>The multiplying footsteps, the view from my window:</i>

00:22:15.917 --> 00:22:21.500
<i>As I drifted along, expressionless</i>

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:25.917
<i>They spilled out of my hands</i>

00:22:25.917 --> 00:22:32.750
<i>It was rocking, swaying--I never knew</i>

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:38.250
<i>Until I touched it with my own hands</i>

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:43.750
<i>I'll gather up</i>
<i>and go through all of the things</i>

00:22:43.750 --> 00:23:02.486
<i>Scattered beneath the waning moon</i>
